      "line": 134,
      "severity": "nit",
      "reviewer": "lodekeeper",
      "body": "Agree. One constraint: `multiFork.test.ts` and `mixedClient.test.ts` still run with `FULU_FORK_EPOCH: Infinity`, and their Lodestar validators publish electra blocks through `publishBlockV2`, so a plain pre-fulu throw would fail both sims. Throwing only when pre-fulu contents carry blobs (`blobs.length > 0`) keeps the sims working, since they never send blob transactions. It also fails loudly instead of publishing a block whose blobs no peer will get.",
