      "body": "Not yet. `multiFork.test.ts` sets `FULU_FORK_EPOCH: Infinity` and calls `assertUnknownBlockSync` (L158), so the head here is an electra block. With this PR, pre-fulu `getBlobSidecars` reads the blob DB, which nothing writes anymore, so it 404s for every electra block and the sim fails without the guard. Once the sims run post-fulu, the guard can go.",
