      "severity": "minor",
      "reviewer": "lodekeeper",
      "body": "Agree. That change also needs proofs: `getBlobs` returns blobs without them, and fulu `publishBlockV2` reads `kzgProofs` as 128 cell proofs per blob. The current `currentSidecars.map((b) => b.kzgProof)` passes one blob proof per blob, which would already be wrong for a fulu head with blobs. It's only never hit because no sim sends blob transactions. So with `getBlobs` the cell proofs need computing, for example with `kzg.computeCellsAndKzgProofs(blob).proofs`.",
